WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.380
Sending your location tells Quickler exactly where your visit was

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.660
without having to type an address.

3
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:11.660
On an iPhone using WhatsApp, tap the plus, then select location and

4
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.140
finally select your current location.

5
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:18.420
For WhatsApp, on an Android, tap the paperclip, then location, and

6
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.040
send your current location.

7
00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:25.300
That is also the same process for on telegram, on Android or on

8
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.080
iPhone where you tap the paperclip, then select location and select

9
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.440
your current location.

10
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:35.280
Quickler uses your location to find the address and the current

11
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.680
weather to add to your record automatically.
